WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:06.840
When you don't have a ribber
and you want to add both knit and purl

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:12.320
stitches for ribbing or textured knitting
on a flatbed machine, you need

00:00:12.386 --> 00:00:15.890
to reform individual stitches.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:21.160
Now, manually reforming stitches is a bit
tedious, especially on the smaller gage

00:00:21.226 --> 00:00:26.850
machines and fine yarn,
but the results are worth the effort.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.800
Begin by casting on with the method
of your choice, but you'll want to choose

00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:34.770
a method that will
stretch with your ribbing.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:38.250
I've used an E-Wrap cast on.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.850
Now, determine the stitch
pattern you want to use.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:46.960
For example, you can use a one by one or
knit one, purl one stitch pattern or two

00:00:47.026 --> 00:00:53.120
by two or any combination of knit
and purl stitches for your ribbing.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:01:00.360
Start by knitting the desired
length of your ribbing.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:06.010
You'll knit and stockinette
for the desired length of your ribbing.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.640
Now, identify the stitch that you want
to reform and insert your latch tool

00:01:11.706 --> 00:01:17.530
in the very bottom or the first
row that stitch on the first row.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:25.240
Unravel the stitch to this point
and then re-latch each strand.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:29.410
This creates a knit stitch as you're
facing the work and a purl

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:32.410
stitch on the opposite side.

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:38.930
Now, you'll want to repeat this for each
one of the stitches that you want reformed

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.880
all the way across your work.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:46.440
When your whole stitch pattern has been
completed and you've reformed all

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:49.240
the stitches,
you just go ahead and continue knitting

00:01:49.306 --> 00:01:51.560
your garment and your ribbing is done.

